":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1331488-the-syndics-and-solars?p=1334520#post1334520\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">24 isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, I was just going with the number Ludek gave, assuming it was accurate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T16:49:58-07:00","id":1334554,"title":"","content":"Upon closer examination, Whitewall is both extremely Orwellian and Gothic Horror(of the &quot;xenophobic, ostensibly 'pure' settlement with a dark secret&quot; variety). Kinda fitting given its neighbors.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T19:05:34-07:00","id":1334565,"title":"","content":"Very reserved public demeanor where all can see. And if you're ever invited in then you're trusted to not rat them out.<br /> <br /> Anywho. Worship of the Unconquered Sun (at least per CoTD: North) tends to worship him more in light how he brings about Spring and ends Winter. <br /> <br /> My guess would be any expansion of that towards the virtues of the UCS by an enterprising Zenith would probably be met with, &quot;Sure, you can reform worship of Ignis Divine. However, make sure your sermons and prayers taught also include The Syndics, as they have been working tirelessly on His behalf to maintain the city.&quot;<br /> <br /> Or some version of The Syndics trying to get included in those prayers to increase their wealth. If prayer even works like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T03:45:54-07:00","id":1334600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ludek</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1331488-the-syndics-and-solars?p=1334508#post1334508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it's nasty form of execution but in creation death by torture is nasty but aceptable form of execution in this case done by fair folk and dead. Also city have other form of exection : exile in winter. So if they bother with it certainly they do not have problem with meeting quota for Fae and Dead</div> </div> </div> </div>The point is that it still denotes something other than &quot;they're gods of peace and health, so they must be really nice&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uknown DarkLord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1331488-the-syndics-and-solars?p=1334565#post1334565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or some version of The Syndics trying to get included in those prayers to increase their wealth. If prayer even works like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It works kind of like that (although you have to be in Heaven for your prayers to manifest as ambrosia), although if say for the Syndics it's a fringe benefit. They're in it for more than just enriching themselves, and that would give their influence on prayer rituals a focus on things like preserving their own cultural and political significance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T12:19:10-07:00","id":1334696,"title":"","content":"The Syndics all have pretty high paying positions in the Celestial Bureaucracy, that's why they can rule Whitewall openly, Chejak can't censure them and they'll curse the Realm with poverty, misfortune, and plague if it tries to march on them. But i'd be hesitant to say that their goals for Whitewall are wholly altruistic, rebuilding Whitewall gives them a control over an extremely productive regional prayer calendar, even if the Sun doesn't notice. Syndic controlled directed prayer from Whitewall makes for a hefty &quot;gift&quot; for any ally or enemy they need to buy off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T12:57:32-07:00","id":1334705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1331488-the-syndics-and-solars?p=1334696#post1334696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Syndics all have pretty high paying positions in the Celestial Bureaucracy, that's why they can rule Whitewall openly, Chejak can't censure them and they'll curse the Realm with poverty, misfortune, and plague if it tries to march on them. But i'd be hesitant to say that their goals for Whitewall are wholly altruistic, rebuilding Whitewall gives them a control over an extremely productive regional prayer calendar, even if the Sun doesn't notice. Syndic controlled directed prayer from Whitewall makes for a hefty &quot;gift&quot; for any ally or enemy they need to buy off.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And they probably have been paying off the Northen Censor Benadamaru for quite some time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}